  '/blog/office-space-sg-highway-ahmedabad-guide': [['Build a total-occupancy-cost model', ['Include rent, common-area maintenance, parking, electricity and demand charges, taxes, insurance, fit-out amortisation, transport, security, technology links and reinstatement. Use best, expected and downside occupancy scenarios.']], ['Protect the expansion plan', ['Ask whether growth can be accommodated on the same floor, in the same tower or only in a future phase. Review rights of first offer, delivery dates and subdivision options. Fragmented growth can affect security, culture and operating cost.']]],
